# The hop in front of the modules this composition routes (MODULES): each
# call is decided against the method it is for and stamped for the module's
# own listener. Its routes to each module's endpoints are hop-routes/ROUTES,
# which Codefly derives from the modules' published API catalogs for this hop
# alone; a composition never authors them. ENDPOINT is the hop's own address.
MODULES=console,records,org-directory
ENDPOINT=${endpoint:authority/hop/grpc}
